<title>USA: Vestaur sets qtly div and year-end extra. [CORRECTED]</title>
<headline>Vestaur sets qtly div and year-end extra. [CORRECTED]</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vestaur Securities Inc said on Thursday it set a quarterly dividend of $0.27 per share and $0.003 cents (corrects from $0.03  cents) per share for the year-end extra dividend.</p>
<p>The distribution is payable on January 16 to stockholders of record December 31.</p>
<p>The company's previous quarterly dividend was $0.27 per share.</p>
<p>Vestaur is a close-end, diversified investment management company.</p>
</text>
